### Task Management API — Tasks (+ nested comments)

@contentType = {{contentType}}

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{managerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{managerPassword}}"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Grab a project to hang tasks off
# @name projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?status=Active&pageSize=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@projectId = {{projects.response.body.$.items[0].id}}

### List tasks — filters: status, priority, projectId, assigneeId, isOverdue, search, sort
# sort: createdAt|dueDate|priority|title|status  (prefix '-' for descending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?pageSize=20&sort=-createdAt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Overdue tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Task statistics (reports:view). Optional ?projectId=
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a task — priority: Low|Medium|High|Critical, dueDate must be in the future
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "REST Client task",
  "description": "Created from tasks.http",
  "projectId": "{{projectId}}",
  "priority": "Medium",
  "estimatedHours": 4,
  "dueDate": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

###
@taskId = {{createTask.response.body.$.id}}

### Get one task
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update task fields
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "REST Client task (edited)",
  "description": "Updated",
  "estimatedHours": 6,
  "actualHours": 2,
  "dueDate": "2030-02-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Change status — workflow: ToDo -> InProgress -> InReview -> Done (single-step back allowed)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "status": "InProgress" }

### Change priority
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/priority
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "priority": "High" }

### Assign the task (assigneeId: null unassigns)
# @name users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "assigneeId": "{{users.response.body.$.items[0].id}}" }

### --- nested comments ---

### List comments on a task
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "content": "Comment from tasks.http" }

### Delete the task (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
